# T_SCRR: the valuation on the screen, its totals by category at the
# end; then the loans report: every open loan as of today, then only
# the overdue ones as of a later date.
S VFORM
K TAB TAB TAB CTRL-S
S VALUE1
K END
S VALEND
K ESC ESC
S LFORM
K TAB TAB CTRL-S
S LOANS
K ESC STAB STAB
T Y
K TAB
T 20261201
K CTRL-S
S OVERDUE
K ESC ESC
